{"hw":"πρόδικος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πρόδικος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πρόδικ-ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">δίκη</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">judged first,</b> <span class=\"gk\">δίκα π.</span> a cause <b class=\"lex-tr\">which has priority of hearing,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">IG</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9(1).334.32</span> </span>(<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Locr.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">v B.C.</span>), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Michel</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">497.2</span> </span>(Aerae, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Act.</span> </span>,<b class=\"lex-tr\">judging in first instance,</b> <span class=\"gk\">πόλις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Schwyzer</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">328a</span> </span> ii<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">B</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8</span> </span>(Delph., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iv B.C.</span>), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5040.63</span> </span>(Crete). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">decided by arbitration,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐθέλω δίκην δοῦναι πρόδικον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">267</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἵνα ἀπολάβῃς τὴν τιμὴν τοῦ βάρδου πρόδικον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">BGU</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">276.12</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii/iii A.D.</span>, cf. ii <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.355</span> </span>). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Subst.</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">defender, avenger,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">450</span> </span>(lyr.); <b class=\"lex-tr\">representative in legal proceedings, advocate,</b> <span class=\"gk\">γυναικὸς ἑαυτοῦ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">BGU</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">969.7</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii A.D.)</span>; esp. of <b class=\"lex-tr\">public advocates,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">IG</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9(1).694.114</span> </span>(Corc.): metaph., <b class=\"lex-tr\">advocate, patron,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τῆς ἐναργείας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1083c</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> at Sparta, a young king's <b class=\"lex-tr\">guardian,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.2.9</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lyc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>.</div></div>"}